    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50a3fb7ea7a63f98fd529723",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "举例来说，\n我能以稳定的单圈时间跑完1600米，\n主要也是因为接收了Master的建议。",
      "source_fingerprint": "713f4c467d59d3a406803ce9d95314a1c92e0a0465826b8438526865e5099de4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
