      "uid": "zhcn:abafd1ad3c1e50d027496fe2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "相遇初期，美浦波旁已经是短距离路线的\n潜力股赛马娘了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "88aa0d12e7bb8bbe73713423e2df14fbb414a0ad71928c0b05dd7f9720923c11",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1026/storytimeline_501026104.json",
